#: ../../operations/reports.rst:2
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "Rapports"

#: ../../operations/reports.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Vue d'ensemble"

#: ../../operations/reports.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| offers 28 different report types which are designed to slice "
"up costing and usage across Clouds, Tenants, and more. Reports can be run"
" on-demand as needed or can be scheduled to run on certain intervals to "
"be viewed at a later time. The list of available report types can be "
"viewed at Operations > Reports."
msgstr "|morpheus| propose 28 types de rapports différents conçus pour segmenter les coûts et l'utilisation entre Clouds, Locataires, et plus encore. Les rapports peuvent être exécutés à la demande ou planifiés à intervalles réguliers pour consultation ultérieure. La liste des types de rapports disponibles se consulte dans Operations > Reports."

#: ../../operations/reports.rst:9
msgid "Tip"
msgstr "Astuce"

#: ../../operations/reports.rst:9
msgid ""
"While |morpheus| offers 28 built-in report types, users may also develop "
"custom reports which display any information that may be needed for your "
"business purposes. Take a look at our `guide to getting started with "
"custom reports "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/guides/custom_reports.html>`_"
" for tips on how to begin the process"
msgstr "Bien que |morpheus| propose 28 types de rapports intégrés, les utilisateurs peuvent également développer des rapports personnalisés affichant toute information nécessaire à vos objectifs métier. Consultez notre `guide de démarrage des rapports personnalisés <https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/getting_started/guides/custom_reports.html>`_ pour des conseils sur la façon de commencer"

